<!--
  Status-bar and Android Auto notification mark.

  Deliberately NOT icon_monochrome. That drawable is scaled to 0.78 so it clears
  the adaptive launcher's safe zone, which is the wrong shape for a notification:
  there is no mask here, so the same artwork would sit in the middle of a 24dp
  box surrounded by dead space. This fills the canvas instead.

  The system tints this a single colour, so the spine must be a hole rather than
  a dark stroke — book paths and a spine rectangle share one evenOdd path.
-->
